graph TB
    User["Data Scientist<br/>(Jupyter workbench / laptop)"]

    subgraph SDK["codeflare-sdk v0.40.1 (Python client library, runs in user process)"]
        Facade["Codeflare facade<br/>SDKConfig + AuthConfig<br/>cf.clusters / cf.jobs"]
        Auth["common.kubernetes_cluster<br/>kube-authkit + CA bundle<br/>deprecated TokenAuthentication"]
        ClusterMod["ray.cluster<br/>RayCluster spec builder<br/>apply (SSA) / delete / status<br/>dashboard URL discovery"]
        RayJobs["ray.rayjobs<br/>RayJob builder<br/>local files to owned Secret"]
        JobClient["ray.client.RayJobClient<br/>wraps Ray JobSubmissionClient"]
        KueueMod["common.kueue<br/>LocalQueue lookup, priority labels<br/>RHBOK / DSC checks"]
        CertGen["common.utils.generate_cert<br/>RSA-3072 / SHA-256 client cert<br/>signed by cluster CA"]
        Widgets["common.widgets<br/>ipywidgets UI"]
        Vendored["vendored.python_client<br/>upstream KubeRay client copy"]

        Facade --> Auth
        Facade --> ClusterMod
        Facade --> RayJobs
        ClusterMod --> KueueMod
        RayJobs --> KueueMod
        ClusterMod --> CertGen
        ClusterMod --> JobClient
        ClusterMod --> Vendored
        RayJobs --> Vendored
        Widgets --> ClusterMod
    end

    LocalTLS["Local TLS dir<br/>~/.local/share/codeflare/tls/cluster-ns/<br/>0700 dir / 0600 files"]
    Migration["scripts/migration/ray_cluster_migration.py<br/>RHOAI 2.x to 3.x"]

    User -->|Python API| Facade
    User -->|Notebook UI| Widgets

    K8sAPI["Kubernetes / OpenShift API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS"]
    RayClusterCR["RayCluster CR<br/>ray.io/v1"]
    RayJobCR["RayJob CR<br/>ray.io/v1"]
    CASecret["cluster-ca-secret-*<br/>(KubeRay/RHOAI owned)"]
    FileSecret["RayJob file Secret<br/>(ownerRef to RayJob)"]

    Auth -->|authenticates| K8sAPI
    ClusterMod -->|server-side apply| RayClusterCR
    RayJobs -->|creates| RayJobCR
    RayJobs -->|creates| FileSecret
    CertGen -->|reads CA + private key| CASecret
    CertGen -->|writes| LocalTLS
    Migration -->|backup / migrate| RayClusterCR

    KubeRay["KubeRay Operator"]
    RayClusterCR -->|reconciled by| KubeRay
    RayJobCR -->|reconciled by| KubeRay
    KubeRay -->|creates| CASecret

    Kueue["Kueue / RHBOK"]
    Gateway["Data-science Gateway<br/>HTTPRoute / Route / Ingress"]
    RayHead["Ray Head<br/>dashboard 8265 / client 10001"]
    KueueMod -->|reads LocalQueue, Workload,<br/>WorkloadPriorityClass| Kueue
    ClusterMod -->|discovers URL| Gateway
    JobClient -->|HTTPS 443 Bearer| Gateway
    Gateway --> RayHead
    CertGen -.->|mTLS 10001| RayHead

